                                "sense_id": "59384ed5-6f82-3c75-8fd2-81a7a55b85b5",
                                "text": "1892: \"A Peep Into the Past\": Brighton in the Olden Time, with Glances at the Present by John George Bishop\nSeparated from the Brewery by the narrow twitten running into Ship-street was \"THE CRICKETERS\""
                            },
                            {
